<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[client name]</span>,<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">In review of your account, I see that you’ve been assigned roles for the Online Enrollment Administrator system access. This assignment makes you responsible for onboarding your company’s employees within the Manage Employees area on Insperity Premier. Insperity offers a variety of resources to assist you and help familiarize you with the necessary steps to successfully onboard your new employees.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>To get started:</b></font></div><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Log in at </span><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/index" style="font-size: 12pt;">portal.insperity.com</a></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">At the bottom of any web page, select </span><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/need_help" style="font-size: 12pt;">Need Help</a></li><ul><li><a href="https://share.articulate.com/9kKBWL5f3ypRx4dJzwYYb" style="font-size: 12pt;">Welcome to Insperity Premier (for Administrators)</a></li><li><font face="arial"><a href="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fservice.insperity.com%2Fservice-technology%2FPaperlessOnboarding%2FAdministrationTutorial%2FIPP%2Fstory.html&amp;data=04%7C01%7Ccusrelcoe%40insperity.com%7C7b3142a87c8f42f8339408d8a6b93c8e%7C895d9ea7ce114131829f33f878d784b2%7C0%7C0%7C637442661799500907%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=Zl123eaBKGkEAkVhHxKYpGfoZk%2B9RYHZD4RCf0wgOzI%3D&amp;reserved=0">Onboarding a New Employee</a></font></li></ul></ul><div style=""><font face="arial">I encourage you to take a moment to review the above videos and download the <a href="https://share.articulate.com/9kKBWL5f3ypRx4dJzwYYb">Enrollment Administration Guide</a> and the <a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/documents/20230329171458932">I-9 Instructions</a>. These guides outline the necessary steps to successfully onboard a new employee using Insperity’s Online Paperless Onboarding process.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Please let me know if I can be of additional support as you review these guides and instruct your employees on the first steps to start their new hire process.<br></font><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>Thank you for trusting Insperity to serve your business.<br><br></span></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>